  "details": "I realized recently that it can be difficult to take a decent thumbnail that encapsulates all that a world has to offer.\n\nIt might be cool if world creators could upload their main thumbnail along with a few different preview stills from their world. This could be done through the SDK like the thumbnail, or possibly through the website afterwards. \n\nPossible use cases: \n\n- Users could hover their cursor over a world's thumbnails to have it start fading between multiple stills to get a better look at the world. This could also occur when you click a world + are browsing it's instances.\n\n- The stills could be shown and faded between within the VRChat loading UI during world download/initialization to pad the wait and add hype.",
